                  <rdf:li>ï»¿ï»¿The Bernafon Encanta is a miniRITE (MNR) rechargeable hearing instrument designed for users with slight to profound hearing loss. It includes LE Audio and BluetoothÂ® Low Energy and supports hands-free communication and direct streaming for iPhone, iPad, Mac and select Androidâ„¢ devices. It is available with the miniFit Detect speaker system, which includes four power levels, and is compatible with a variety of domes and custom moulds.  ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿ï»¿1) Hands-free communication is available on select devicesï»¿ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿WARNING: No modification of this equipment is allowed.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Apple, the Apple logo, iPhone, iPad, Mac and the Mac logo are trademarks of Apple Inc., registered in the U.S. and other countries.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;   &#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Speaker 60ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Speaker 85ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Speaker 100ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Speaker 105ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;MNR&#xA;&#xA;MNR&#xA;&#xA;MNR&#xA;&#xA;MNR&#xA;Technical Data&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Encanta 400ï»¿ï»¿ | 300 | 200 | 100&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿miniRITEï»¿ï»¿&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Operating and charging conditions&#xA;Temperature: +5Â°C to +40Â°C (41Â°F to 104Â°F) &#xA;Humidity: 5% to 93% relative humidity, &#xA;non-condensing&#xA;Atmospheric pressure: 700 hPa to 1060 hPaï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Transportation and storage conditions&#xA;Temperature and humidity shall not exceed the mentioned limits for extended periods during transportation and storage:ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Transport&#xA;Temperature: -20Â°C to +60Â°C (-4Â°F to 140Â°F) &#xA;Humidity: 5% to 93% relative humidity, &#xA;non-condensing&#xA;Atmospheric pressure: 700 hPa to 1060 hPaï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Storage&#xA;Temperature: -20Â°C to +30Â°C (-4Â°F to 86Â°F)&#xA;Humidity: 5% to 93% relative humidity, &#xA;non-condensing&#xA;Atmospheric pressure: 700 hPa to 1060 hPaï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿  ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿This hearing aid also comes as DemoFlex with the same technical data.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿For information on compatibility, please visit www.bernafon.com/compatibility.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;Technical features&#xA;&#xA;Accessories&#xA;Hands-free communication1&#xA;Bluetooth Low Energy technology&#xA;LE Audio&#xA;NFMI (Near-Field Magnetic Introduction)&#xA;Single push-button&#xA;miniFit Detect speakers&#xA;LED visual indicator&#xA;Pulsing LED&#xA;Faster charging&#xA;&#xA;Bernafon App&#xA;RC-A (remote control)&#xA;TV-A (TV adapter)&#xA;SoundClip-A&#xA;Bernafon Charger miniRITE (MNR)&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Frequency (Hz)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Frequency (Hz)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Frequency (Hz)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Frequency (Hz)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Frequency (Hz)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Frequency (Hz)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Frequency (Hz)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Frequency (Hz)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿dB HLï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿dB HLï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿dB HLï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿dB HLï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿dB HLï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿dB HLï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿dB HLï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿dB HLï»¿ï»¿&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Fitting rangesï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Bernafonï»¿ï»¿ ï»¿ï»¿Encanta 400ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Bernafonï»¿ï»¿ ï»¿ï»¿Encanta 300ï»¿ï»¿ | 200 | 100&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Feature overviewï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿                                           ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;&#xA;Encanta 400&#xA;Encanta 300&#xA;Encanta 200&#xA;Encanta 100&#xA;Smart sound processing&#xA;Smart Amplification&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€ƒFrequency bandwidth&#xA;10 kHz&#xA;8 kHz&#xA;8 kHz&#xA;8 kHz&#xA;Smart Noise Management&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€ƒSmart Noise Reduction&#xA;5 options&#xA;4 options&#xA;3 options&#xA;2 options&#xA;â€ƒDirectionality Preference&#xA;4 options&#xA;4 options&#xA;4 options&#xA;3 options&#xA;â€ƒâ€ƒSmart Directionality States&#xA;3 options&#xA;2 options&#xA;-&#xA;-&#xA;â€ƒâ€ƒOmni Preference&#xA;2 options&#xA;2 options&#xA;-&#xA;-&#xA;Smart Sensor&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;-&#xA;-&#xA;Speech and Noise Balancer&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;-&#xA;-&#xA;â€ƒSpeech Balancer&#xA;3 options&#xA;2 options&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€ƒNoise Balancer&#xA;4 options&#xA;2 options&#xA;-&#xA;-&#xA;Smart Feedback Canceller&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Windâ€‰|â€‰Contact Noise Protector&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Audibility and comfort&#xA;Low Frequency Enhancer&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Frequency Composition&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Binaural Noise Manager&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;-&#xA;Transient Noise Reduction&#xA;6 options&#xA;5 options&#xA;4 options&#xA;2 options&#xA;Dynamic Range Extender&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;-&#xA;-&#xA;Soft Noise Manager&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Directionality options&#xA;Smart Directionality&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;-&#xA;Adaptive Full Directionality&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Fixed Directionality&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Fixed Omni&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€ƒOmni Directional&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;-&#xA;-&#xA;â€ƒPinna Effect&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;-&#xA;-&#xA;Individualisation&#xA;Personalisation&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Fitting bands&#xA;24&#xA;20&#xA;18&#xA;14&#xA;Program options/memories&#xA;13/4&#xA;12/4&#xA;12/4&#xA;9/4&#xA;Music Experience&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Binaural coordination: VC, program changes&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Automatic Adaptation Manager&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Transition&#xA;4 options&#xA;3 options&#xA;2 options&#xA;1 option&#xA;Data Logging&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€ƒConversation Data &#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Spoken indicators&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;Tap control&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;-&#xA;Tinnitus SoundSupport&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;CROS compatibility&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;â€¢&#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Ear Simulatorï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿1)   Measured with the gain control of the hearing aids set to their full-on position minus 20 dB and with an input SPL of 70 dB. This is to obtain a gain response equal to the full-on gain &#xA;response from e.g. IEC 60118-0:1983+A1:1994 but without influence of feedback.&#xA;2)  Expected operating time for rechargeable battery depends on use pattern, active feature set, hearing loss, sound environment, battery age and use of wireless accessories.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Encanta 300 | 200 | 100ï»¿ï»¿ ï»¿ï»¿miniRITEï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Measured according to IECÂ 60118-0:1983/AMD1:1994, IECÂ 60118-0:2015, IECÂ 60118-1:1995+AMD1:1998Â CSV and IECÂ 60318-4:2010ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;       &#xA;ï¿¼   ï»¿ï»¿Speaker 60ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼   ï»¿ï»¿Speaker 85ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼   ï»¿ï»¿Speaker 100ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼   ï»¿ï»¿Speaker 105ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿OSPL90 (dB SPL)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿OSPL90 (dB SPL)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Full-on gain (dB)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Full-on gain (dB)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Frequency response (dB SPL)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Frequency response (dB SPL)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Technical information&#xA;Omnidirectional mode is used &#xA;unless otherwise stated.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿ï»¿ï»¿ï»¿ï»¿                  ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;&#xA;Speaker 60&#xA;Speaker 85&#xA;Speaker 100&#xA;Speaker 105&#xA;OSPL90, Peak (dB SPL)&#xA;120&#xA;127&#xA;132&#xA;135&#xA;OSPL90, 1600 Hz (dB SPL)&#xA;113&#xA;121&#xA;130&#xA;133&#xA;OSPL90, HFA (dB SPL)&#xA;113&#xA;121&#xA;129&#xA;131&#xA;Full-on gain, Peak (dB)&#xA;44&#xA;66&#xA;69&#xA;72&#xA;Full-on gain, 1600 Hz (dB)1&#xA;40&#xA;54&#xA;65&#xA;65&#xA;Full-on gain, HFA (dB)&#xA;39&#xA;56&#xA;65&#xA;65&#xA;Reference test gain (dB)&#xA;33&#xA;46&#xA;54&#xA;57&#xA;Frequency range (Hz)&#xA;&lt;100-7500&#xA;&lt;100-7500&#xA;&lt;100-7500&#xA;&lt;100-7500&#xA;Telecoil output, 1 mA/m field (1600 Hz) (dB SPL)&#xA;71&#xA;85&#xA;97&#xA;97&#xA;Telecoil output, 10 mA/m field (1600 Hz) (dB SPL)&#xA;91&#xA;105&#xA;117&#xA;117&#xA;Total harmonic distortion&#xA;(Input 70 dB SPL), 500 Hz (%)&#xA;&lt;2&#xA;&lt;2&#xA;&lt;2&#xA;&lt;2&#xA;Total harmonic distortion&#xA;(Input 70 dB SPL), 800 Hz (%)&#xA;&lt;2&#xA;&lt;2&#xA;&lt;3&#xA;&lt;3&#xA;Total harmonic distortion&#xA;(Input 70 dB SPL), 1600 Hz (%)&#xA;&lt;3&#xA;&lt;3&#xA;&lt;2&#xA;&lt;3&#xA;Equivalent input noise level, Omni (dB SPL)&#xA;17&#xA;22&#xA;16&#xA;17&#xA;Equivalent input noise level, Dir (dB SPL)&#xA;27&#xA;30&#xA;26&#xA;27&#xA;Battery&#xA;Lithium-ion&#xA;Lithium-ion&#xA;Lithium-ion&#xA;Lithium-ion&#xA;Expected operating time, hours2&#xA;24&#xA;24&#xA;24&#xA;24&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Speaker 60ï»¿ï»¿ / 100&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Acoustic input: 60 dB SPL&#xA;Magnetic input: 31.6 mA/mï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Speaker 85ï»¿ï»¿ / 105&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Acoustic input: 60 dB SPL&#xA;Magnetic input: 31.6 mA/mï»¿ï»¿&#xA;       &#xA;ï¿¼   ï»¿ï»¿Speaker 60ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼   ï»¿ï»¿Speaker 85ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼   ï»¿ï»¿Speaker 100ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼   ï»¿ï»¿Speaker 105ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿OSPL90 (dB SPL)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿OSPL90 (dB SPL)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Full-on gain (dB)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Full-on gain (dB)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Frequency response (dB SPL)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Frequency response (dB SPL)ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï¿¼&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿2CC Couplerï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿1)   Measured with the gain control of the hearing aids set to their full-on position minus 20 dB and with an input SPL of 70 dB. This is to obtain a gain response equal to the full-on gain &#xA;response from e.g. IEC 60118-0:1983+A1:1994 but without influence of feedback.&#xA;2)  Expected operating time for rechargeable battery depends on use pattern, active feature set, hearing loss, sound environment, battery age and use of wireless accessories.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Encanta 300 | 200 | 100ï»¿ï»¿ ï»¿ï»¿miniRITEï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Measured according to ANSI S3.22-2014, &#xA;IECÂ 60118-0:2015 and IECÂ 60318-5:2006ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿Technical information&#xA;Omnidirectional mode is used &#xA;unless otherwise stated.ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;ï»¿ï»¿ï»¿ï»¿ï»¿ï»¿                  ï»¿ï»¿&#xA;&#xA;Speaker 60&#xA;Speaker 85&#xA;Speaker 100&#xA;Speaker 105&#xA;OSPL90, Peak (dB SPL)&#xA;109&#xA;116&#xA;123&#xA;126&#xA;OSPL90, 1600 Hz (dB SPL)&#xA;104&#xA;112&#xA;121&#xA;125&#xA;OSPL90, HFA (dB SPL)&#xA;105&#xA;113&#xA;121&#xA;123&#xA;Full-on gain, Peak (dB)&#xA;34&#xA;55&#xA;59&#xA;63&#x